  "priorExpiration": "1997-05-09",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 403.01 Class A Major Sources. Pursuant to RSA 125-D:3, I(f)(1), as an alternative to complying with the emissions reductions specified in RSA 125-D:3, I(b) the owner or operator of 2 or more sources under common ownership may combine the annual emissions of all such sources to demonstrate that the total annual emissions of such sources do not exceed 75 percent of their baseline emissions for class A major sources.\n\nSource. #120, eff 8-31-73; ss by #721.5, eff 12-7-75; ss by #718, eff 12-7-75; ss by #1717, eff 2-19-81; ss by #2332, eff 4-29-83; ss by #2938, eff 12-27-84; ss by #5033, eff 12-27-90; EXPIRED 12-27-96\n\nNew. #6424, INTERIM, eff 1-9-97, EXPIRES 5-9-97; ss and moved by #6469-B, eff 3-5-97 (from Env-A 406); ss and moved by #8233, eff 12-22-04; ss by #10288, eff 3-19-13; ss by #13641, eff 5-23-23",
